&lt;p&gt;Music creation is a dream that many have. However, this dream is hard to achieve for the estimated 1.3 billion people worldwide&lt;sup&gt;[1]&lt;/sup&gt; living with disabilities. Traditional instruments and software can be inaccessible, leaving many to be unable to express their creativity with music. Hence, our mission is to make music inclusive and limitless for everyone.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Research</title><link>https://jamboxx-infinite.github.io/research/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Nov 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://jamboxx-infinite.github.io/research/</guid><description>&lt;div class="floating-toc"&gt;
