&lt;div style="text-align: justify; font-size: 18px;"&gt;
Testing Jamboxx-Infinite was a crucial step to ensure our application meets the standards of our goals. Our main testing strategy was through user testing as we focus on delivering an application that offers user experience that is desirable. We implemented pseudo-user tests and user tests to inquire about the functionalities, usability, and receive feedbacks about further improvements and features throughout the development of our project.
&lt;p&gt;To ensure the features of each section of our application works as intended, we identifed the sections of Jamboxx-Infinite for testing.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>UI Design</title><link>https://jamboxx-infinite.github.io/ui-design/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Nov 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://jamboxx-infinite.github.io/ui-design/</guid><description>&lt;div class="floating-toc"&gt;
